{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development","id":909478,"title":"Paradox IP Protection and Open Development","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-07T14:23:16-07:00","id":909478,"title":"Paradox IP Protection and Open Development","content":"Just posting to see if this has an answer, but does anyone know if Paradox's crackdown on threats to the IP has any effect on open development of Onyx Path products? I definitely realize these issues are hardly the same, but I admit I have little understanding of these things and would just like to know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T14:36:49-07:00","id":909495,"title":"","content":"Clarify the question?<br /> <br /> Considering talks were already had, I think the general answer is no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T16:24:36-07:00","id":909569,"title":"","content":"Not that I've seen. The public playtest for changeling document basically shows like 75% of Changeling 2e, abit not tge lastest verison.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T16:49:32-07:00","id":909589,"title":"","content":"Doing an open development is no more a threat to IP protections than giving away copies of a book for free.<br /> <br /> If Onyx Path did a give away and gave you a book for free, it doesn't change your legal rights of what you can and can't do with that book.<br /> <br /> Open Development documents are likewise still protected under copyright laws, and their existence isn't a threat to things like Paradox in the sense of needing to defend their trademarks. Licensed use of their trademarks are being used for products associated with their trademark. There's no legally implicit lose of control over the trademark in the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T19:11:17-07:00","id":909715,"title":"","content":"If you are wondering what might change, it might be silent approval for posting large excerpts from books on these forums during discussions. Which always stroke me as strange, because I literally never visited an RPG forum where game company would be ok with people literally copy pasting whole sections of their books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T22:47:20-07:00","id":909860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development?p=909715#post909715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you are wondering what might change, it might be silent approval for posting large excerpts from books on these forums during discussions. Which always stroke me as strange, because I literally never visited an RPG forum where game company would be ok with people literally copy pasting whole sections of their books.</div> </div> </div> </div>Always struck me similarly, but it's such a productive stance for actual discussion, it'll be a shame to see it go if it does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T03:00:55-07:00","id":913974,"title":"","content":"The big factor is permission. The subnet contained a multitude of extensive excerpts from currently-in-print books, that were hosted online without the explicit consent of the owners. Open Development is published with the direct consent of the line developer. For example, all Mage:the Awakening 2e Open Development content was published by Dave Brookshaw; while the consent may not have explicit, that's only because people don't tell themselves that they can do things. <br /> <br /> Regarding forum discussions, I think those will be on the safe side, if only due to how unorganized it is. It's the difference between a link to [insert rule] and [insert rule] being posted in one of probably many topics that deal with [insert rule] as well as any closely related topics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T07:53:16-07:00","id":917352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development?p=909715#post909715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you are wondering what might change, it might be silent approval for posting large excerpts from books on these forums during discussions. Which always stroke me as strange, because I literally never visited an RPG forum where game company would be ok with people literally copy pasting whole sections of their books.</div> </div> </div> </div>This and Open Development have resulted in multiple book sales for me that probably otherwise wouldn't have happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1881-the-cowardly-scion","name":"The Cowardly Scion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1881_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T10:42:49-07:00","id":929817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development#post909478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just posting to see if this has an answer, but does anyone know if Paradox's crackdown on threats to the IP has any effect on open development of Onyx Path products? I definitely realize these issues are hardly the same, but I admit I have little understanding of these things and would just like to know.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It has no effect at all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T18:21:34-08:00","id":1003724,"title":"","content":"Not try to skirt the forum rules here but someone ended up creating a subnet mirror site. was there some kind of plagiarism going on? Because i didn't know what was happening until the owner started &quot;negotiating&quot; with onyx path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T18:28:04-08:00","id":1003728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bwgustaf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development?p=1003724#post1003724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not try to skirt the forum rules here but someone ended up creating a subnet mirror site. was there some kind of plagiarism going on?</div> </div> </div> </div>The sight literally copied and pasted entire chapters of material directly from the books.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bwgustaf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development?p=1003724#post1003724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because i didn't know what was happening until the owner started &amp;quot;negotiating&amp;quot; with onyx path.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure what you're trying to refer to here, but the C&amp;D came from White Wolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T20:04:34-08:00","id":1003756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/909478-paradox-ip-protection-and-open-development?p=1003728#post1003728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The sight literally copied and pasted entire chapters of material directly from the books.<br /> <br /> <br /> Not sure what you're trying to refer to here, but the C&amp;D came from White Wolf.</div> </div> </div> </div> After the c&amp;d the owner posted this: By request from the lawyers of Paradox Entertainment, this site has been temporarily removed from the Internet with no ill-will or hostility towards Paradox for defending their Copyrights.<br /> <br /> I am currently pursuing a way to alter the site and its content so that the RP Portal may return to the community without violating any copyrights. Helping the community over the years has been a passion of mine, one that I will pursue until my dying breath. Whether it's continuing to do it all by myself or by other means... I will be out there in some fashion. Count on it.<br /> <br /> White Wolf itself recently stated in their blog and on their Facebook pages that they are currently renewing/refreshing the Dark Pack fan site rules so that sites like this one can be online to help the community as it has done for a long time. More information on the revised and clarified rules for Dark Pack sites will be announced at the 25th Anniversary Grand Masquerade event in New Orleans, perhaps even sooner if we are lucky.<br /> <br /> Don't understand if he's trying to exploit some kind of loophole, but i don't really understand what the point of the notice is if he plans to plagiarize content anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T20:47:51-08:00","id":1003765,"title":"","content":"Eh, sounds more like blame avoidance to me. I doubt Paradox would allow full sections of either CofD or WoD books to be posted online. Like, I love System Resource Documents and all, but the split between Pathfinder and D&amp;D 4e shows exactly the type of financial risk that Paradox will be looking to avoid, and without an SRD licensing agreement, I really don't see how they would be able to post rules from the books or the open dev online without getting cease-and-desisted. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-16T08:11:42-08:00","id":1003944,"title":"","content":"That site was literally so complete that people used it instead of books to create characters and run games. Like, literally, if your buddy would say &quot;I'm going to run Werewolf, make yourself a character and understand your rules&quot;, this site was enough copy-paste to help you create Werewolf (or any other splat, really) character with access to every single bit of extra material in extra published books. Basically, it rendered actual books - if not the core, then definitely expansions - irrelevant for chargen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}